  "description": "Code-first AsyncAPI document generation for ASP.NET Core. Describe channels, operations and messages with attributes or a fluent API, then serve the generated AsyncAPI 2.6 or 3.1 document from your app with MapAsyncApi() — or write it at build time. Supports XML doc comments, message examples, protocol bindings (SignalR, gRPC, SSE, WebRTC), multiple documents and Native AOT.",
